# API and Contracts

- **REST base:** `/api/v1`. All requests/responses: `Content-Type: application/json`.
- **JSON:** camelCase for property names (e.g. `projectId`, `cardCount`). Align with `Docs/DTO Description.md` and `Docs/Описание REST API.md`.
- **Dates:** ISO 8601 in UTC (e.g. `2025-12-03T10:00:00Z`).
- **Errors:** Standardised **ProblemDetails** (RFC 7807): `type`, `title`, `status`, `detail`, `instance`; validation errors in `errors` object.
- **Lists:** Use **PaginatedResponseDto&lt;T&gt;** when returning paged data: `items`, `pageNumber`, `totalPages`, `totalCount`, `hasPreviousPage`, `hasNextPage`.

When adding or changing endpoints or DTOs, check `Docs/DTO Description.md` and `Docs/Описание REST API.md`. For the **inclusive** microservice, use the same contracts when calling BFF or PVS.
